# GokoWeb — Complete Project Reference

## Project Overview

**GokoWeb** (`goko-premium`) is a full-stack web application for **Goko Hostel & Community Space** in Gokarna, India. It combines a marketing website, a guest self check-in system, and an operations admin panel.

| Aspect | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Purpose** | Hostel marketing site + operational backend |
| **Domain** | `https://www.gokohostel.com` |
| **Framework** | Next.js 15.5 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, shadcn/ui |
| **Forms** | react-hook-form + Zod |
| **Database** | Cloudflare D1 (SQLite) via Drizzle ORM |
| **Deployment** | Cloudflare Workers via @opennextjs/cloudflare |
| **Worker** | `goko-hostel-latest-webpage` (wrangler.jsonc) |

---

## Key Features

### Public Marketing Site (7+ pages)
Home, Events, Stay, Community Area, Story, Reviews, FAQs, How to Reach, Things to Do, Booking Enquiry. Global shell with sticky header, footer, WhatsApp float, Book Now gate (Stayflexi).

### Guest Self Check-in (`/self-checkin`)
- Mobile-first form with ID upload + real-time Vision API validation
- Returning guest lookup by phone (reuses prior Drive links)
- Foreign guest Form C fields + passport/visa OCR
- Booking platform + ID capture
- Uploads to Google Drive; records in D1

### Admin Panel (`/admin`)
Six sections (password-protected):

| Section | Component | Purpose |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Dashboard | `AdminDashboard` | Today's check-ins/checkouts, occupancy |
| Bookings | `AdminBookings` | OTA bookings, Gmail sync |
| Beds | `AdminBeds` | Visual bed map, assign/checkout/change |
| Timeline | `AdminTimeline` | Multi-day occupancy grid |
| Records | `AdminRecords` | Monthly check-in CRUD, Form C |
| Management | `AdminManagement` | Dorms, users, backup, audit, logs, health, rates |

**Roles:** `admin`, `manager`, `staff`

### Form C / FRRO Automation
- Passport MRZ + visa OCR parsing (8 languages)
- Local Playwright server for auto-fill
- Bookmarklet/console script for mobile
- See `frro-form-c-findings.mdc` for full technical details

### Bed Management
- Dorm setup (Bunk, Bunk2L1U, Single)
- Lifecycle: available → occupied → cleanup → available
- Bed history audit trail

### Booking Management
- Manual + Gmail sync (MakeMyTrip, Booking.com, Hostelworld)
- Email parsing via `otaEmailParser.ts`

### Rate Scraping
- GitHub Actions workflow dispatches Puppeteer scraper
- Results stored and displayed in admin UI

