## Database Schema (D1)

### `checkins`
Core guest records: name, contact, nationality, arrival/departure dates, ID links (Drive URLs), verification status, `form_c_data` JSON, booking platform/ID, month key.

### `beds`
Bed inventory: dorm_id, bed_id, position (Upper/Lower/Single), type, status, guest info, dates.

### `dorms`
Dorm names (unique).

### `bed_history`
Audit trail: bed_id_label, dorm, action, guest info, timestamp.

### `bookings`
OTA/manual bookings: guest, platform, ref, dates, room type, payment status, source.

### `settings`
Key-value store: `image_validation`, OAuth tokens, FRRO credentials, etc.

### `users`
Admin users: username, password_hash, role, permissions (JSON).

### `audit_log` / `system_logs`
Observability: who did what, errors, API calls.

### `api_stats`
Monthly counters: vision, drive, sheets, total.

### `rate_scrapes`
Competitor rate data: city, dates, results (JSON), status.

