## API Routes

| Route | Method | Description |
|-------|--------|-------------|
| `/api/checkin` | POST | Guest self check-in (multipart) |
| `/api/checkin/lookup` | GET | Returning guest lookup by phone |
| `/api/validate-id` | POST | Real-time ID/visa Vision validation |
| `/api/settings` | GET | Public feature flags |
| `/api/admin/checkins` | POST | Monolithic admin API (40+ actions via `action` field) |
| `/api/admin/upload` | POST | File upload to Google Drive |
| `/api/bookings/sync` | POST | Gmail OTA booking sync |
| `/api/form-c/[id]` | GET | Tokenized Form C data + photo for FRRO |
| `/api/auth/google/start` | GET | OAuth initiation |
| `/api/auth/google/callback` | GET | OAuth callback |

### Admin API Actions (via `action` field)
**Records:** list, add, addPast, update, delete, verifyCheckin, checkoutGuest, undoCheckout
**Form C:** getFormCData, reExtractFormC, updateFormCData
**Dashboard:** getDashboard
**Beds:** getBeds, assignBed, checkoutBed, markClean, unassignBed, changeBed
**Dorms:** initDorms, removeDorm, removeBed
**Settings:** getSetting, setSetting, getStats, healthCheck
**Users:** getUsers, createUser, updateUser, deleteUser
**Audit:** getAuditLog, getSystemLogs, runBackup
**Bookings:** getBookings, getUpcomingBookings, addBooking, updateBookingStatus, deleteBooking
**Rates:** getLatestRateScrape, getRateScrapeStatus, startRateScrape, updateRateScrapeResults

