## OCR Parsing (`src/lib/parsePassportData.ts`)

Supports 8 languages: English, German, French, Dutch, Hebrew, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese.

Key techniques:
- MRZ parsing for core passport fields
- Date elimination method for date of issue (finds all dates, removes known DOB/expiry)
- Next-line matching for EU multilingual label format
- Fuzzy regex for visa type OCR errors
- normalizeDate supports EN/FR/DE/NL/ES/IT/PT month abbreviations
